{
  "component": "M18-T0280-v5.0",
  "name": "ATR",
  "component_version": 1,
  "case": "constant_range",
  "derivation": "Every bar is O=100.00 H=101.00 L=99.00 C=100.00, so from bar 1 onward TR = max(H-L=2.00, |H-Cprev|=1.00, |L-Cprev|=1.00) = 2.00. Bar 0 has no previous close and yields no true range. With period=14 the fourteenth true range arrives at bar index 14, where Wilder's seed is the mean of fourteen 2.00 = 2.00. Every subsequent step is (2.00*13 + 2.00)/14 = 2.00, so the series is flat at 2.00.",
